Package: SILK
Type: Package
Title: Shift-Invariant Learned Kernel for Survival Prediction Under Origin-Time Error
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Mehrdad", "Mohammadi", email = "mohammadi.mehrdad93@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Author: Mehrdad Mohammadi [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Mehrdad Mohammadi <mohammadi.mehrdad93@gmail.com>
Description: Implements the SILK (Shift-Invariant Learned Kernel) method for
    absolute risk prediction under common origin-time measurement error. SILK
    registers biomarker trajectories using exact characteristic Gaussian,
    Laplace, or Matern biomarker kernels and a conditional mean embedding, then calibrates landmark
    ages for survival prediction. Includes simulation, prediction evaluation,
    and publication-quality visualization tools.
